    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Most young people in Chondath accept their four years of mandatory military service, but you chafed at that authoritarian attempt to control your life. You renounced your nationality, cast off your given name, and signed on as a freebooter with the first ship that would take you. Since then you have roamed the Vilhon Reach. You have never sailed more than a few dozen leagues from shore, but your strong local connections and the breadth of your experience make up for it.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Dexterity, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.feats24.Item.phbftSkilled0000]{Skilled}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Athletics and Sleight of Hand</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulWeaversToo]{Weaver's Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepDagger0000]{Dagger}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulWeaversToo]{Weaver's Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBackpack000]{Backpack}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBallBearing]{Ball Bearings}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBasket00000]{Basket}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBedroll0000]{Bedroll}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBucket00000]{Bucket}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRations0000]{Rations} (3 days' worth), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRope0000000]{Rope}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagSignalWhist]{Signal Whistle}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 38 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
